# FreeBASIC examples rsync excludes
#
# Example packages should ship sources and data, not binaries left behind by
# local compile sweeps.  The source tree clean rule removes known generated
# targets first; these patterns catch platform-specific leftovers that do not
# have a stable make target name.

*.a
*.asm
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.stderr.txt
*.stdout.txt
manual/proguide/hello.txt
obj/
